  "description": "After a drunken night, Yi-Yool wakes up to find his boss, Hyun-Mo, making breakfast in nothing but an apron. But the surprises don’t end there—Hyun-Mo has a proposition. He wants to date Yi-Yool, and he’s got a contract to back it up. If Yi-Yool sticks to the deal, his dream of transferring to the UK branch is within reach. But as the lines between business and romance blur, Yi-Yool is left questioning... is this really love, or just a contract?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
